         <head>MEMOIRS OF LOUIS XIV.</head>
         <pb/>
         <div type="div1">
            <head>Quotes and Images From Memoirs of Louis XIV.</head>
            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>Duc de Saint-Simon</head>
               <lg>
                  <l/>
